  "attributes": [],
  "category": {
    "name": "held-items",
    "url": "/api/v2/item-category/12/"
  },
  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "あしばに　しかけられた\nわななどの　えいきょうを　うけなくなる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "발밑에 설치된\n함정 등의 영향을 받지 않게 된다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "攜帶後，將不會受\n腳下的陷阱等所影響。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Le porteur ne subit plus les effets des pièges\nou autres entraves posés sur le terrain.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Der Träger wird nicht mehr durch Fallen und andere\nObjekte beeinträchtigt, die auf dem Boden liegen.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Anula los efectos de aquello que se coloca a los pies\ndel Pokémon para obstaculizarlo, como las trampas.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Protegge il Pokémon che ce l’ha dagli effetti di trappole\ne di altri ostacoli piazzati ai suoi piedi.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "These boots prevent the effects of traps set on\nthe battlefield.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "足場に　しかけられた\n罠などの　影響を　受けなくなる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "不受脚下陷阱等的影响。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
